---
<Tunnel title="No Computer - Player Checks | Save My Gig!" status="Critical · No Laptop" red>
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Step 1 of 3</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.25rem">Work the booth</h2>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Pull the USB out. Wait 10 seconds. Push it back in firmly.</li>
    <li>Try the <strong>other slot</strong> on the same player.</li>
    <li>Try the <strong>other player</strong>. If it reads, play from there and use Link.</li>
    <li>Wipe the USB tip. Sweat and dirt are real causes.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Does any player read it now?</p>

  <Choice step="no_laptop_1"
    a={{ href: '/saved?path=critical&branch=no_laptop', label: 'YES, IT IS READING', event: 'outcome_reached', data: { outcome: 'saved', path: 'critical' } }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/critical/no-laptop-2', label: 'NO, STILL NOTHING' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
